{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling, bite-sized adventure to the far reaches of the cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A routine scouting mission to uncover the source of mysterious blue crystals has taken a dramatic turn! Your ship is caught in the crossfire of an intergalactic war on the other side of the universe. Now, you must navigate treacherous alien worlds, engage in pulse-pounding encounters with strange enemies, and solve mind-bending puzzles to find your way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced action, perfect for quick gaming sessions:</strong> Blast through 100 unique, short levels spread across bizarre alien landscapes. Each level offers a condensed burst of excitement, ideal for casual play on the go or during short breaks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging challenges:</strong> Test your reflexes and strategic thinking with action-packed combat and clever puzzles that will keep you on the edge of your seat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a cosmic mystery:</strong> A captivating storyline weaves through your journey, revealing the secrets behind the blue crystals and the intergalactic conflict.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a wild ride through the cosmos! Add to your\u00a0wishlist\u00a0now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore strange worlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441160/extras/b749e0e10dc46d91accf76557208b104.avif?t=1748531282\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441160/extras_big/b749e0e10dc46d91accf76557208b104.avif?t=1748531282 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage into fierce fights but be smart and know stop and back off.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441160/extras/c0dd1df9568e29a0333090b32a652b4c.avif?t=1748531282\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441160/extras_big/c0dd1df9568e29a0333090b32a652b4c.avif?t=1748531282 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect hull upgrades and new weapons along the way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441160/extras/85da3a7adf97ce7ab1e6c798c9f03cc6.avif?t=1748531282\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441160/extras_big/85da3a7adf97ce7ab1e6c798c9f03cc6.avif?t=1748531282 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles to proceed forward.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441160/extras/abd3fbbe14686ed884094434c3fae45b.avif?t=1748531282\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441160/extras_big/abd3fbbe14686ed884094434c3fae45b.avif?t=1748531282 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make unexpected friends.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441160/extras/73447604290ec8d07179213dba7bc8e8.avif?t=1748531282\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441160/extras_big/73447604290ec8d07179213dba7bc8e8.avif?t=17485312